---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import artistImage from "../images/contact-image.jpg";
---

<section class="artist-statement">
  <div class="text-content-container">
    <div class="text-content">
      <div class="bio-heading">
        <h2>Biography</h2>
        <div class="line"></div>
      </div>
      <p>
        For me ART is so much more than just painting a pleasing image. I try to convey with paint a celebration of this amazing planet we occupy. I want to record not just beauty, but a message beyond the actual picture i.e. the emotions a scene evokes. That’s why I sometimes paint Film Noir scenes to express our complicated human condition – I call it Art Noir.
      </p>
      <p>
        I can’t remember when I was not drawing and painting. Making art expressed ideas I did not have the words for when I was young.  Now that I am so much older, again I do not have adequate words to express my shock about our country’s current situation. But I will forever hold onto hope that people are basically good. Making art most definitely affects how I feel about our current politics. I feel hope and joy when I am painting.
      </p>
      <p>
        I paint in oils and watercolor, displaying my work in several California and Utah galleries.  In Escondido, Carlsbad and Oceanside I have earned 15 First Place, Second Place, Third Place and Honorable Mention ribbons in the past five years.
      </p>
      <p>
        I have sold my work from three galleries, and they now hang in many homes in the United States and in Australia.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <Image src={artistImage} alt="" class="artist-image" />
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @use "../styles/column-layouts" as *;
  @use "../styles/breakpoints" as *;

  section {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .text-content-container {
    padding-right: var(--section-gap);
    padding-left: var(--side-margin);
    padding-top: 312px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .text-content {
    max-width: col-width(5);
  }

  .bio-heading {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .line {
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: var(--border-color);
  }

  p {
    color: var(--subtle-text);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: $breakpoint-md) {
    section {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .text-content-container {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      padding-inline: var(--side-margin);
      padding-top: 0;
    }
    .artist-image {
      max-width: col-width(5);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: $breakpoint-sm) {
    section {
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }
  }
</style>